        Kind of makes you wonder wtf we were doing before... The bitch went down in the scheduled 15 seconds. <BR><BR>And now I present, Ladies Krystara and Ultangel...<BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://www.rikasi.com/sw/images/Raids/Chardok011229/krys2hs.jpg'><IMG SRC='http://www.rikasi.com/sw/images/Raids/Chardok011229/ult2hs.jpg'></TD></TR><BR><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/Jagged_Blade_of_War.jpg'></TD></TR><BR><TR><TD align='center' valign='center'><IMG SRC='http://www.rikasi.com/sw/images/Raids/Chardok011229/krys1hs.jpg'><IMG SRC='http://www.rikasi.com/sw/images/Raids/Chardok011229/ult1hs.jpg'></TD></TR><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/Blade_of_Tactics.jpg'><BR><IMG SRC='http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/Blade_of_Strategy.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE> 
