    <TR>
      <TD STYLE='padding-left: 30px; padding-right: 30px;' 
          CLASS='NewsRow' WIDTH='100%' COLSPAN='2'>
        <div Class='NewsTitle'><FONT SIZE=100> UP YOURS GORENAIRE </FONT></DIV>
        <BR>
        Okay, so I took a while to update the news after I said I would... <BR><BR>Bah, was outta town stuffing my face.<BR><BR>Anyhow, So as I was going to say, poor Vumon and Hadurz have been staring at that sexy wall in SolB waiting for Santa Claus to come.<BR><BR>You know that M&M commercial where Santa and the M&Ms see each other and both faint saying &quot;they do exist?&quot;. <BR>Well, even after seeing our buddy Zordak Ragefire 3 times already, and knowing for a fact he does exist, it's always a surprise to see him say hello.<BR><BR>So once again, I was yanked outta bed at 7am after a very deep sleep of about an hour (bah, needed to get up for my plane anyhow), and rushed to the computer to see this :<BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://www.rikasi.com/sw/images/Raids/Gore011227/zordak.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>So Naturally, I go ooh, he does exist !<BR><BR>Anyhow, to make a long story short, Pearl is handed in, Zordak goes nutso...<BR><BR>Anyone else have memorable ding messages like this ?<BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://www.rikasi.com/sw/images/Raids/Gore011227/ding.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>Anyhow, to make a long story short :<BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://www.rikasi.com/sw/images/Raids/Gore011227/RFDead.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://www.rikasi.com/sw/images/Raids/Gore011227/vumon.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR><BR><BR>Well, one can say that's enough right ? Well, to quote a very funny movie, <H1>Never Give UP ! Never Surrender</H1> we headed to DL today to give that big ole dragon an ass woopin...<BR><BR>After 2 fun wipeouts, we had a bunch of people leave (mostly out of guild guests) and we saw how much guild members cared about getting this done. I was getting tells left and right about how we rocked and this person or that person would not leave until they either fell asleep or we got this done. I think it was pretty much something we needed to do.<BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://www.rikasi.com/sw/images/Raids/Gore011227/fight.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR><BR>As the title so eloquently says, Gorenaire died ;)<BR><BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://www.rikasi.com/sw/images/Raids/Gore011227/GoreDead.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>Loot was pretty good. Unfortunately, we didn't get a scale for Tiri, but you know what, we've done it, we can do it again.<BR><BR>Spells were Banishement, Aegis of Ro, Spirit of Oak, and Talisman of the Raptor.<BR><BR>Torn, Frost Covered Book went to <B>Lestr</B><BR>Karvuul's  Mystic Pouch went to <B>Liquidstayce</B><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics10/kavruulspouch.GIF'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR>Runed Bolster Belt went to <B>Loomis</B><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics10/runedbolsterbelt.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR>Shield of the White Dragon to <B>Blunts</B><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/shield_white_dragon.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://www.rikasi.com/sw/images/Raids/Gore011227/BluntsLoot.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>Not a bad week =)<BR><BR>Happy holidays folks, hope you have much fun ! 
        <BR><BR>
        Submitted by <SPAN class='NewsSubmitter'> <A HREF='/View_Member.php?Name=Princy' target='_blank'>Princy Planeshifter</A>/<A HREF='/View_Member.php?Name=Palmia' target='_blank'>Palmia Masters</A> at 00:38:49</SPAN>
        <BR><BR><BR><BR>
