    <TR>
      <TD STYLE='padding-left: 30px; padding-right: 30px;' 
          CLASS='NewsRow' WIDTH='100%' COLSPAN='2'>
        <div Class='NewsTitle'>You win some, you lose some...</DIV>
        <BR>
        Howdy folks, our resident Scaly lizard is on vacation, enjoying the frosty delights of snow and Poutine... <BR><BR>For those of you who don't know what <A HREF='http://www.cs.umanitoba.ca/~gedetil/poutine.shtml' target='_blank'>poutine</A> is, it ROCKS !<BR><BR>But I digress, you guys don't care about poutine hehe...<BR><BR>Well, we were doing stuff on Saturday everyone in their corners when all of the sudden we get the news that Gorenaire is up...<BR><BR>We all know that Tiri's been doing everything she can to NOT get her epic, but we decided to force her to try...<BR><BR>This is us just before we pulled her :<BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://www.rikasi.com/sw/images/Raids/Gore021222/pregore.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>We were ready, we were pumped...<BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://www.rikasi.com/sw/images/Raids/Gore021222/PostGore.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>Oh well hehe... We did get her down to about 40%.. Thanks to everyone who came (Including the folks SoS lent us and the Anklespankers).<BR><BR>We gave up after two tries because we needed to clear the FGs for Ragewatch 2002 and keep our d0rf alive so that was that.<BR><BR>I don't want to depress everyone, so we did get soooome stuff done today =)<BR><BR>I was fast asleep when my phone rang and the sexy voice of our fearless bard leader informed me to get my ass out of bed and kill Severilsomethingorother. <BR><BR>So I did, and let me tell you something, I am NOT made for waking up early (10am hehe) on Sundays but I was functioning.<BR><BR>Anyhow, I brought Princy and Palmia there but we said screw it and use the poutine lover's shaman since we had like 14 enchanters there and you can never have too much Shadooooo !<BR><BR>We'd like to thank our friends from CT and Euphoria who came to help us... It was a little rushed due to the sudden appearance of 20 Kylin Eyes in the zone (we figured we'd better get our acts together and kill it hehe).<BR><BR>This is what I saw on the Vikor's screen during Sev:<BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://www.rikasi.com/sw/images/Raids/Sev021223/VikorCast.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>Quite fun ;)<BR><BR>Anyhow, here's Sev dead =)<BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://www.rikasi.com/sw/images/Raids/Sev021223/SevDown.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>Loot was ok, Krystara now only needs to kill our arch enemy the Queen of chardok. We got 2 or 3 spells (there's still a bit of confusion over that one hehe). <BR><BR>Sev also dropped a burnt book for pally FA, and in keeping with the generous nature of SW, we did a /shout any pallies in the zone ? You can bet that the ONE paladin there was a happy camper.<BR><BR>They decided to reward the uberly useful Vikor with the <B>Shield of the Green Dragon</B> that dropped :<BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics13/shield_green_dragon.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>And here he is, wielding it (Isn't he sexy with his braided beard)...<BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://www.rikasi.com/sw/images/Raids/Sev021223/VikorLoot.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>That's our weekend folks, just wanted to thank everyone who's been sitting at Ragefire for a while, our two about to be uber clerics really appreciate it...<BR><BR> 
        <BR><BR>
        Submitted by <SPAN class='NewsSubmitter'> <A HREF='/View_Member.php?Name=Princy' target='_blank'>Princy Planeshifter</A>/<A HREF='/View_Member.php?Name=Palmia' target='_blank'>Palmia Masters</A> at 00:26:47</SPAN>
        <BR><BR><BR><BR>
      </TD>
    </TR>
