    <TR>
      <TD STYLE='padding-left: 30px; padding-right: 30px;' 
          CLASS='NewsRow' WIDTH='100%' COLSPAN='2'>
        <div Class='NewsTitle'>Day 2 in the Plane of Air</DIV>
        <BR>
        What an insane day! We started off on Pegasi island, where we had left off yesterday and cleared it once again.<BR><BR>We then paid a little visit to the Overseer of Air (the same who kicked our asses so bad THREE times last night) and well... we got revenge =)))<BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://home.attbi.com/~antigel/ooa3.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>And I couldn't resist to post this.<BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://home.attbi.com/~antigel/slow.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>/em adds the Overseer of Air to the list<BR><BR>We then proceeded forward and boldly went where no SW had gone before: the Spiroc Island. After a few experiments to figure out how the island works (and many, many rezzes), we killed the red birds until only the Guardian and the Lord were left.<BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://home.attbi.com/~antigel/spiroc_lord.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE><BR><BR>Final Score:   Spiroc Lord 1    Serenity Within 5<BR><BR>Many congratulations goes to:<BR><BR><b>Zytar</b> on his Black Silk Cape (Necromancer Epic)<BR><b>Mynn</b> on her Belt of Contention and Spiroc Wingblade (Warrior Epic)<BR><b>Vardion</b> on his Belt of Contention<BR><b>Stonebiter</b> on his Symbol of Marr and Belt of Virtue<BR><b>Poltergeist</b> on his Enchanter Epic book (this one went unnoticed =( )<BR><b>Vumondo</b> on his Belt of Contention and Spiroc Wingblade<BR><b>Krystara</b> on her Spiroc Wingblade<BR><b>Jexel</b> on his Belt of the Pine and Swirling Sphere (Ranger Epic)<BR><b>Exzalius</b> on his Swirling Sphere (Ranger Epic)<BR><b>Lestr</b> on his Symbol of Marr and Belt of Virtue<BR><b>Quagmire</b> on his Bracer of Distortion<BR><b>Scithe</b> on his Bracer of Distortion<BR><b>Lemy</b> on his Stein of Flowing Ichor<BR><b>Zargon</b> on his Belt of Contention<BR><b>Chatriel</b> on her Golden Efreeti Turban<BR><BR>Not to mention TONS and TONS of quest items that will probably allow us to complete a few quests.<BR><BR>Thank you all for making it so easy and for stretching it for our warriors. It is deeply appreciated!<BR><BR><b>Quote of the Day</b> goes to Mynn<BR><BR><BR><TABLE WIDTH='100%'><TR><TD align='center'><IMG SRC='http://home.attbi.com/~antigel/quote.jpg'></TD></TR></TABLE> 
        <BR><BR>
        Submitted by <SPAN class='NewsSubmitter'> <A HREF='/View_Member.php?Name=Rikasi' target='_blank'>Rikasi Shan</A>/<A HREF='/View_Member.php?Name=Vikor' target='_blank'>Vikor MacLeod</A> at 01:29:38</SPAN>
        <BR><BR><BR><BR>
      </TD>
    </TR>
