    <TR>
      <TD STYLE='padding-left: 30px; padding-right: 30px;' 
          CLASS='NewsRow' WIDTH='100%' COLSPAN='2'>
        <div Class='NewsTitle'>Day 1 in the Plane of Air</DIV>
        <BR>
        Thanks to everyone for this very nice day. Everything went very smoothly. A raid made easy on the leader =))<BR><BR>The first major event of the day was the slaying of Noble Dojorn (and his 2 fellas). Congratulation to <b>Gold</b> on her Golden Efreeti Gloves and <b>Daedelous</b> on his Golden Efreeti BP.<BR><BR><img src='http://home.attbi.com/~antigel/daed.jpg'><BR><BR>We then worked our way up the islands and we were able to complete one of the toughest quest known to date: The Fiery Avenger. Congratulation <b>Stonebiter</b>, you've been working on that one for a LOOOOOOOOOOOOONG time.<BR><BR><img src='http://home.attbi.com/~antigel/stonebiter.jpg'><BR><BR>The list of awards is simply too long and to be honest I don't even remember it =). Playing two chars, pulling, slowing and leading the raid kept me pretty busy...<BR><BR>We did try the Overseer of Air THREE times... and we failed all 3 times. Even though, I still think the last attempt was a winner... but the spiked lag monster said otherwise. A 10 seconds laps against an unslowed mob hitting for 750dmg... well... that hurts..<BR><BR><img src='http://home.attbi.com/~antigel/ooa1.jpg'><BR><BR><img src='http://home.attbi.com/~antigel/ooa2.jpg'><BR><BR>That's about that time I noticed something very unusual. Take a look for yourself and please... if you can explain the tail on <b>Vardion</b> let me know...<BR><BR><img src='http://home.attbi.com/~antigel/vardion.jpg'><BR><BR>Congratulation everyone on a job well done. This was by far the best PoA trip SW had so far. Let's see if we can push the 'Terra Incognita' line a bit farther tomorrow! 
        <BR><BR>
        Submitted by <SPAN class='NewsSubmitter'> <A HREF='/View_Member.php?Name=Rikasi' target='_blank'>Rikasi Shan</A>/<A HREF='/View_Member.php?Name=Vikor' target='_blank'>Vikor MacLeod</A> at 22:36:10</SPAN>
        <BR><BR><BR><BR>
      </TD>
    </TR>
